<title>USA: True North unit acquires Venezuelan stake.</title>
<headline>True North unit acquires Venezuelan stake.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foote, Cone &amp; Belding, a unit of True North Communications Inc, said Friday it has acquired majority-equity ownership in AJL Publicidad C.A. in Venezuela.</p>
<p>AJL is a full-service advertising agency located in Caracas, Venezuela.</p>
<p>Foote, Cone &amp; Belding currently owns two other agenices in Venezuela.</p>
<p>True North shares were unchanged at 20-7/8 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
